          "line": 30,
          "quote": "2026-03-17T09:28:00.000Z,51.82,248.51,0.0811,360"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "HTTP error rate increased from 0.0013 at 09:00 to a peak of 0.086 at 09:54, with p95 latency rising from ~172ms to over 1000ms.",
      "citations": [
